    "text": "Consider three vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. If <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is maximum and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to",
